    <h1>Lost Your Passport in the Philippines?</h1>

    <p>We can help you understand the immigration steps that may follow the loss or replacement of your passport, and coordinate the relevant immigration documentation once a replacement travel document has been issued by the appropriate embassy or consular authority.</p>

    <div class="notice-box">
      <p>Passport issuance and replacement is handled solely by your country's embassy or consulate in the Philippines. Foreign Immigration Services does not issue passports. Our role concerns the related Philippine immigration processing and record updates once your replacement travel document has been issued.</p>
